# env.required — a LinkedIn engager source is the hard gate, but it can be satisfied THREE
# different ways, so no single variable is unconditionally required. Provide AT LEAST ONE
# of these (all listed in env.optional):
#   - APIFY_API_TOKEN         primary: managed actors for post discovery + engager extraction
#   - PHANTOMBUSTER_API_KEY   + a LinkedIn session cookie on the phantom   (--source phantombuster)
#   - LI_AT                   LinkedIn li_at cookie                         (--source playwright)
# Without one of these there is no LinkedIn scrape path and no engagers to extract.
